, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg backdrop-blur-sm relative z-10 border border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/40 via-purple-900/20 to-emerald-900/30 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.2),_0_0_15px_rgba(147,51,234,0.2)] p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center web3-dual-gradient-text-glow\">Buy WAGAToken</h2><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"grid w-full grid-cols-2 mb-6 bg-black/30 border border-emerald-500/20 p-1 rounded-lg\"><button class=\"rounded-md py-2 transition-all duration-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-600/30 to-emerald-700/30 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/50\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-900/50 flex items-center justify-center mr-2\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 2C15.866 2 20 6.477 20 12C20 17.523 15.866 22 12 22C8.13401 22 4 17.523 4 12C4 6.477 8.13401 2 12 2Z\" fill=\"#6D4C41\"></path><path d=\"M11.5 4C12.5 6 14 9.5 14 12.5C14 15.5 12.5 18 11.5 20\" stroke=\"#3E2723\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div>Buy with ETH</div></button><button class=\"rounded-md py-2 transition-all duration-200 bg-transparent text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-300\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-900/50 flex items-center justify-center mr-2\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 2C15.866 2 20 6.477 20 12C20 17.523 15.866 22 12 22C8.13401 22 4 17.523 4 12C4 6.477 8.13401 2 12 2Z\" fill=\"#6D4C41\"></path><path d=\"M11.5 4C12.5 6 14 9.5 14 12.5C14 15.5 12.5 18 11.5 20\" stroke=\"#3E2723\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></sv