ce-nowrap rounded-md text-sm ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2 w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-emerald-800 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-emerald-700 text-white font-medium transition-all duration-200\">Connect Wallet to Buy</button></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-800\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-sm\"><span class=\"text-gray-400\">Token Price:</span><span class=\"text-white font-medium\">$<!-- -->...<!-- --> USD</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-sm mt-2\"><span class=\"text-gray-400\">Min Purchase:</span><span class=\"text-white font-medium\">$<!-- -->...<!-- --> USD</span></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800/50\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 italic text-center\">This is a demonstration interface. No actual transactions will be processed.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 text-center\"><a class=\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center\" href=\"#features\">Learn more about WAGAProtocol<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"py-20 bg-emerald-950/30 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\"><span class=\"web3-dual-gradient-text-glow\" style=\"color:transparent;background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-image:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 1), rgba(147, 51, 234, 1), rgba(16, 185, 129, 1));background-size:300% auto\">Key Features</span></h2><p class=\"mb-16 text-lg text-gray-400\">Our utility token provides multiple benefits across the WAGA ecosystem</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg relative z-10 border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/40 to-emerald-800/20 shadow-emerald-500/20 h-full p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400 to-teal-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-coins h-6 w-6 text-black\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M18.09 10.37A6 6 0 1 1 10.34 18\"></path><path d=\"M7 6h1v4\"></path><path d=\"m16.71 13.88.7.71-2.82 2.82\"></path></svg></div></div></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-300 glow-text\">Staking Rewards</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400\">Stake WGTN tokens to earn a share in the platform&#x27;s earnings and access exclusive features in the WAGA ecosystem.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.2), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.15), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg relative z-10 border-purple-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-900/40 to-purple-800/20 shadow-purple-500/20 h-full p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-400 to-purple-600 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-percent h-6 w-6 text-black\"><line x1=\"19\" x2=\"5\" y1=\"5\" y2=\"19\"></line><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"2.5\"></circle></svg></div></div></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-300 glow-text\">Discounts</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400\">Token holders enjoy exclusive discounts when purchasing WAGA coffee products, enhancing value for loyal customers.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg relative z-10 border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/40 to-emerald-800/20 shadow-emerald-500/20 h-full p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-400 to-emerald-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap h-6 w-6 text-black\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></div></div></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-300 glow-text\">Academy</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400\">Gain access to role-based training and employment opportunities throughout the WAGA ecosystem.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.2), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.15), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg relative z-10 border-purple-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-900/40 to-purple-800/20 shadow-purple-500/20 h-full p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-400 to-purple-600 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gem h-6 w-6 text-black\"><path d=\"M6 3h12l4 6-10 13L2 9Z\"></path><path d=\"M11 3 8 9l4 13 4-13-3-6\"></path><path d=\"M2 9h20\"></path></svg></div></div></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-300 glow-text\">Capability Building</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400\">Contribute directly to smallholder coffee farmer capability building programs, supporting sustainable coffee production.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-start-2\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg relative z-10 border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/40 to-emerald-800/20 shadow-emerald-500/20 h-full p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-400 to-teal-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6 text-black\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div></div></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-300 glow-text\">Distributor Access</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400\">Token holders gain priority access to distributor opportunities in the WAGA ecosystem, enabling participation in the global coffee value chain.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\"><span class=\"web3-dual-gradient-text-glow\" style=\"color:transparent;background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-image:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 1), rgba(147, 51, 234, 1), rgba(16, 185, 129, 1));background-size:300% auto\">Tokenomics</span></h2><p class=\"mb-16 text-lg text-gray-400\">A balanced token allocation designed for long-term sustainability and growth</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\"><div><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-xl opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2), rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-xl opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border backdrop-blur-md border-emerald-400/40 border-r-purple-500/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-800/30 to-purple-900/30 h-full p-8 web3-card-glow\"><h3 class=\"mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-purple-300 purple-glow\">Token Allocation</h3><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\"><span class=\"text-gray-300\">Community Rewards &amp; Staking</span><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-medium\">30<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full h-2.5\"><div class=\"bg-emerald-400 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:30%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\"><span class=\"text-gray-300\">Public Token Sale</span><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-medium\">30<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full h-2.5\"><div class=\"bg-purple-400 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:30%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\"><span class=\"text-gray-300\">Private Token Sale</span><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-medium\">10<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full h-2.5\"><div class=\"bg-teal-400 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:10%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\"><span class=\"text-gray-300\">Founding Team &amp; Advisors</span><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-medium\">5<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full h-2.5\"><div class=\"bg-blue-400 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:5%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\"><span class=\"text-gray-300\">Development Team Personnel</span><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-medium\">10<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full h-2.5\"><div class=\"bg-indigo-400 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:10%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\"><span class=\"text-gray-300\">Development Fund</span><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-medium\">5<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full h-2.5\"><div class=\"bg-pink-400 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:5%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\"><span class=\"text-gray-300\">Community Engagement Fund</span><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-medium\">10<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full h-2.5\"><div class=\"bg-yellow-400 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:10%\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg relative z-10 border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/40 to-emerald-800/20 shadow-emerald-500/20 h-full p-8\"><h3 class=\"mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400 glow-text\">Token Utility</h3><ul class=\"space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><div class=\"mr-4 mt-1 relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3 text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Community governance participation rights</p></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><div class=\"mr-4 mt-1 relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3 text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Fee reductions on platform transactions</p></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><div class=\"mr-4 mt-1 relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3 text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Access to premium features and services</p></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><div class=\"mr-4 mt-1 relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3 text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Participation in community-driven initiatives</p></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><div class=\"mr-4 mt-1 relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-sm\"></div><div class=\"relative flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3 text-emerald-400\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Staking rewards from platform revenue</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-emerald-950/30 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\"><span class=\"web3-dual-gradient-text-glow\" style=\"color:transparent;background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-image:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 1), rgba(147, 51, 234, 1), rgba(16, 185, 129, 1));background-size:300% auto\">Token Launch Roadmap</span></h2><p class=\"mb-16 text-lg text-gray-400\">Creating the WAGA Experience</p></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-8 last:mb-0\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg z-10 border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/40 to-emerald-800/20 shadow-emerald-500/20 p-6 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 opacity-10 flex items-center justify-center text-6xl\">噫</div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"md:w-1/3\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400 glow-text\">Phase 1: Initial Development</h3><span class=\"inline-block mt-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-800/60 text-emerald-300 px-3 py-1 text-xs\">Q1-Q2 2025</span></div><div class=\"md:w-2/3\"><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Utility token (WAGAToken) presale launch alongside MVP development completion and WAGA Academy curriculum development.</p><div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center text-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-400\" href=\"#\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-1 h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 last:mb-0\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.2), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.15), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg z-10 border-purple-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-900/40 to-purple-800/20 shadow-purple-500/20 p-6 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 opacity-10 flex items-center justify-center text-6xl\">剥</div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"md:w-1/3\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-purple-300 purple-glow\">Phase 2: Pilot &amp; Feedback</h3><span class=\"inline-block mt-2 rounded-full bg-purple-800/60 text-purple-300 px-3 py-1 text-xs\">Q2-Q4 2025</span></div><div class=\"md:w-2/3\"><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Launch pilot study with coffee producers, integrate DeFi functionalities for liquidity pools, and run community-driven campaigns to boost adoption.</p><div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300\" href=\"#\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-1 h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 last:mb-0\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg z-10 border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/40 to-emerald-800/20 shadow-emerald-500/20 p-6 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 opacity-10 flex items-center justify-center text-6xl\">嶋</div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"md:w-1/3\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400 glow-text\">Phase 3: Scaling &amp; Optimization</h3><span class=\"inline-block mt-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-800/60 text-emerald-300 px-3 py-1 text-xs\">Q1 2026</span></div><div class=\"md:w-2/3\"><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Implement learnings from pilot study, add advanced features like decentralized trade finance, and secure global partnerships with coffee industry stakeholders.</p><div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center text-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-400\" href=\"#\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-1 h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 last:mb-0\"><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.2), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2))\"></div><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg opacity-0 blur-xl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.15), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15))\"></div><div class=\"rounded-lg b